# first: S6, S7 and S8 all take "first efficient cause" as the member of an ordered series of causes that has no prior cause in it. Calling it God in S8 adds a name; it does not shift the sense.
# ultimate: S6 says "ultimate cause" and S7 says "ultimate effect". Both pick out the last member of the series, so the wording differs but the sense does not.
